        "original_id": "ffcdd100-307a-55a1-b60c-8c822378584e",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Ed Wood, Fernand Rivers, Bela Lugosi, Dolores Fuller\n- Works: Glen or Glenda\n- Roles: filmmaker, actor, writer, producer, director, screenwriter\n- Places: Saint-Lager\n\nFacts:\n- Fernand Rivers was born François Large on 6 September 1879 in Saint-Lager and became a French actor, screenwriter, film producer, and director.\n- Glen or Glenda is a 1953 American drama film written, directed by, and starring Ed Wood.\n- In Glen or Glenda, Ed Wood was credited in his starring role as \"Daniel Davis.\"\n- Glen or Glenda features Bela Lugosi and Ed Wood's then-girlfriend Dolores Fuller.\n- Ed Wood, born Edward Davis Wood Jr. on October 10, 1924, was an American filmmaker, actor, writer, producer, and director.\n- Fernand Rivers died on 12 September 1960.\n- Ed Wood died on December 10, 1978.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
